 agrees well with the amoebic spectrum 
\begin_inset Formula $\sigma_{\text{Amoeba}}$
\end_inset

.
 The spectra of the strip geometries are approximated by the corresponding strip-GBZ spectra (
\begin_inset Formula $\sigma_{\text{strip 1}}$
\end_inset

